Package: rocket-client
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: glib-networking, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good
Description: lightweight Rocket.Chat messaging client
 A GTK 4 / libadwaita client for Rocket.Chat servers, written in C.
 It connects over HTTPS (port 443) or plain HTTP (port 80) and receives
 messages in real time over the Rocket.Chat WebSocket (DDP) API.
